<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/19th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Anglo-Persian War</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1856">1856</a>–<a href="/years/1857">1857</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Anglo-Persian War was fought between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/qajar-dynasty">Qajar</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/persia">Persia</a> from November 1856 to April 1857, after Persia occupied <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/herat">Herat</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/afghanistan">Afghanistan</a>. British and Indian forces landed in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/persian-gulf">Persian Gulf</a>, took <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bushehr">Bushehr</a> and won at Khushab and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khorramshahr">Mohammerah</a>. By the Treaty of Paris of 1857 Persia withdrew from Herat and renounced its claims there.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/anglo-persian-war.jpg" alt="Anglo-Persian War" width="320" height="227" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Koosh-Ab_Battle_Persia_British_cavalry_charge.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
